{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-optimization","title":"推理优化：让大模型在成本约束下服务用户","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/engineering/inference-optimization","wordCount":1176,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理优化-让大模型在成本约束下服务用户\">推理优化：让大模型在成本约束下服务用户</h1><p>训练一个强大的 Transformer 模型只是开始——让它以可接受的延迟和成本服务数百万用户才是真正的工程挑战。2026 年，一个 70B 参数模型的单次推理涉及 1400 亿次浮点运算，KV Cache 占用数十 GB 显存，而用户期望的响应延迟在百毫秒级。推理优化是将模型从实验室搬到生产环境的&quot;最后一公里&quot;。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>LLM 推理分为两个阶段，各自有不同的计算特征和优化策略：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    INPUT[用户输入] --&gt; PREFILL[Prefill 阶段]&#10;    PREFILL --&gt; DECODE[Decode 阶段]&#10;    DECODE --&gt; TOKEN1[Token 1]&#10;    DECODE --&gt; TOKEN2[Token 2]&#10;    DECODE --&gt; TOKENN[Token N ...]&#10;    PREFILL -.- NOTE1[计算密集: 并行处理所有输入 token]&#10;    DECODE -.- NOTE2[内存密集: 逐 token 自回归生成]\">graph LR\n    INPUT[用户输入] --&gt; PREFILL[Prefill 阶段]\n    PREFILL --&gt; DECODE[Decode 阶段]\n    DECODE --&gt; TOKEN1[Token 1]\n    DECODE --&gt; TOKEN2[Token 2]\n    DECODE --&gt; TOKENN[Token N ...]\n    PREFILL -.- NOTE1[计算密集: 并行处理所有输入 token]\n    DECODE -.- NOTE2[内存密集: 逐 token 自回归生成]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>计算特征</th>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>关键指标</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prefill</td>\n<td>Compute-bound</td>\n<td>FLOPS</td>\n<td>TTFT (Time to First Token)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode</td>\n<td>Memory-bound</td>\n<td>HBM 带宽</td>\n<td>TPS (Tokens Per Second)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>整体</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>综合</td>\n<td>延迟 × 吞吐 × 成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"kv-cache-推理的内存支柱\">KV Cache：推理的内存支柱</h2><p>每次生成一个新 token，模型需要与之前所有 token 的 Key/Value 向量计算注意力。KV Cache 缓存这些历史向量，避免重复计算。但它的内存占用随序列长度线性增长：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>KV Cache 大小</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>layers</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mtext>kv_heads</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mtext>head</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>seq_len</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>dtype_bytes</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{KV Cache 大小} = 2 \\times n_{\\text{layers}} \\times n_{\\text{kv\\_heads}} \\times d_{\\text{head}} \\times \\text{seq\\_len} \\times \\text{dtype\\_bytes}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">KV Cache </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">大小</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">layers</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">kv_heads</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">head</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">seq_len</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dtype_bytes</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 Llama 3 70B（80 层、8 KV 头、128 维、FP16）为例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>4K 序列：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>4096</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 80 \\times 8 \\times 128 \\times 4096 \\times 2 = 1.3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4096</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span></span></span></span></span> GB</li>\n<li>128K 序列：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>80</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>128</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>131072</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>42</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2 \\times 80 \\times 8 \\times 128 \\times 131072 \\times 2 = 42</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">80</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">128</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">131072</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">42</span></span></span></span></span> GB</li>\n</ul>\n<p>当需要同时服务数百个并发请求时，KV Cache 的总内存需求远超模型参数本身。</p>\n<p><strong>PagedAttention（vLLM）</strong>：借鉴操作系统的虚拟内存管理，将 KV Cache 分成固定大小的&quot;页&quot;，按需分配和回收，消除内存碎片。2026 年 vLLM 和 SGLang 默认使用此技术，将 KV Cache 的有效利用率从 ~60% 提升到 ~95%。</p>\n<h2 id=\"模型量化-用更少的-bit-表示参数\">模型量化：用更少的 bit 表示参数</h2><p>量化将模型参数从 FP16/BF16（16 bit）压缩到 INT8/INT4 甚至更低位宽，在几乎不损失质量的前提下将模型大小和推理速度提升 2-4 倍。</p>\n<p><strong>权重量化（Weight-Only Quantization）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>quant</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>round</mtext><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>W</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mi>s</mi></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>dequant</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mtext>quant</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">W_{\\text{quant}} = \\text{round}\\left(\\frac{W - z}{s}\\right), \\quad W_{\\text{dequant}} = s \\cdot W_{\\text{quant}} + z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">round</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">dequant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">quant</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（scale）和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span>（zero-point）按 group 计算（通常 128 个元素一组）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量化方案</th>\n<th>位宽</th>\n<th>模型体积</th>\n<th>质量损失</th>\n<th>速度提升</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>FP16 基准</td>\n<td>16-bit</td>\n<td>140 GB (70B)</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8 (W8A8)</td>\n<td>8-bit</td>\n<td>70 GB</td>\n<td>&lt;1%</td>\n<td>~2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4 (GPTQ/AWQ)</td>\n<td>4-bit</td>\n<td>35 GB</td>\n<td>1-3%</td>\n<td>~3x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>MXFP8</td>\n<td>8-bit (MX 格式)</td>\n<td>70 GB</td>\n<td>&lt;0.5%</td>\n<td>~2x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT4 + FP8 KV</td>\n<td>混合</td>\n<td>~40 GB</td>\n<td>1-2%</td>\n<td>~3x</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的趋势是<strong>MXFP8</strong>（Microscaling FP8）——NVIDIA Blackwell 原生支持的新数据格式，在 FP8 的低精度基础上通过 block-level scaling 保持 FP16 级的精度。MiniMax M3 已支持 MXFP8 推理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推测解码-用小模型加速大模型\">推测解码：用小模型加速大模型</h2><p>推测解码（Speculative Decoding）的核心思想：让一个小而快的&quot;草稿模型&quot;（Draft Model）先生成多个候选 token，再让大模型一次性并行验证。如果草稿被接受，等效于大模型一次前向传播生成了多个 token。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>加速比</mtext><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>γ</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{加速比} \\approx \\frac{1}{1 - \\alpha + \\alpha / \\gamma}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">加速比</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2574em;vertical-align:-0.936em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.936em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 为草稿接受率，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0556em;\">γ</span></span></span></span></span> 为草稿模型的速度优势倍数。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 推测解码的概念流程&#10;def speculative_decode(draft_model, target_model, prompt, n_speculate=5):&#10;    # 1. 草稿模型快速生成 n 个候选 token&#10;    draft_tokens = draft_model.generate(prompt, n=n_speculate)&#10;    # 2. 目标模型一次前向传播验证所有候选&#10;    target_logits = target_model.forward(prompt + draft_tokens)&#10;    # 3. 逐位置验证：接受概率 = min(1, p_target/p_draft)&#10;    accepted = 0&#10;    for i, token in enumerate(draft_tokens):&#10;        accept_prob = min(1.0, target_logits[i][token] / draft_logits[i][token])&#10;        if random() &lt; accept_prob:&#10;            accepted += 1&#10;        else:&#10;            break&#10;    # 4. 从第一个被拒绝位置重新采样&#10;    return prompt + draft_tokens[:accepted] + resample(target_logits[accepted])\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 推测解码的概念流程</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> speculative_decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(draft_model, target_model, prompt, n_speculate</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 1. 草稿模型快速生成 n 个候选 token</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    draft_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_model.generate(prompt, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">n</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">n_speculate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 2. 目标模型一次前向传播验证所有候选</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_logits </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_model.forward(prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 3. 逐位置验证：接受概率 = min(1, p_target/p_draft)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accepted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(draft_tokens):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        accept_prob </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, target_logits[i][token] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_logits[i][token])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> random() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> accept_prob:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            accepted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            break</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    # 4. 从第一个被拒绝位置重新采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_tokens[:accepted] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> resample(target_logits[accepted])</span></span></code></pre></div><p>2026 年的实践中，草稿接受率通常在 70-85%（代码生成场景更高），实际加速比为 2-3 倍。Medusa、Eagle 等变体通过共享底层表示进一步减少草稿生成的开销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批处理与调度-continuous-batching\">批处理与调度：Continuous Batching</h2><p>传统的 static batching 要求一批请求的输入/输出长度一致，导致短请求等待长请求完成（队头阻塞）。Continuous Batching 允许：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个迭代步动态加入新请求</li>\n<li>已完成的请求立即释放资源</li>\n<li>不同请求独立进行 prefill 或 decode</li>\n</ul>\n<p>vLLM 和 SGLang 通过 PagedAttention + Continuous Batching 的组合，将 GPU 利用率从 ~30%（static batch）提升到 ~80%。</p>\n<p><strong>Disaggregated Inference（NVIDIA Dynamo）</strong>：将 prefill 和 decode 分离到不同的 GPU 池：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Prefill 池：配置为计算密集型，使用高算力 GPU</li>\n<li>Decode 池：配置为内存密集型，使用高带宽 GPU</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这解决了 prefill 和 decode 资源需求不匹配导致的利用率问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>LLM 推理的两阶段（prefill/decode）有根本不同的计算特征，需要分别优化</li>\n<li>KV Cache 管理（PagedAttention）解决内存碎片，是高并发服务的基础</li>\n<li>量化（INT4/MXFP8）以微小质量代价换取 2-4 倍的速度和内存节省</li>\n<li>推测解码利用小模型加速大模型的自回归生成，提供 2-3 倍加速</li>\n<li>Continuous Batching + Disaggregated Inference 最大化 GPU 利用率</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本章前一篇 <a href=\"efficient-attention\">高效注意力</a>解决的是注意力计算本身的效率问题</li>\n<li>本章下一篇 <a href=\"training-infrastructure\">训练基础设施</a>讨论大规模分布式训练的并行策略</li>\n<li>跨库：<a href=\"../../llm-fine-tuning/deployment/adapter-merging-serving\">LLM 微调部署中的 Adapter 合并与服务</a>讨论如何在推理引擎中高效管理多个 LoRA adapter</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"推理优化：让大模型在成本约束下服务用户","id":"推理优化-让大模型在成本约束下服务用户"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"KV Cache：推理的内存支柱","id":"kv-cache-推理的内存支柱"},{"level":2,"text":"模型量化：用更少的 bit 表示参数","id":"模型量化-用更少的-bit-表示参数"},{"level":2,"text":"推测解码：用小模型加速大模型","id":"推测解码-用小模型加速大模型"},{"level":2,"text":"批处理与调度：Continuous Batching","id":"批处理与调度-continuous-batching"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"高效注意力：突破二次方计算瓶颈","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/engineering/efficient-attention"},"next":{"title":"训练基础设施：千卡集群的分布式训练工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/nlp-transformers/engineering/training-infrastructure"}}